  "body": "@domenic suggested that I link asserts to the infra spec. However, Bikeshed didn't generate pretty markup when I did this and the example here doesn't seem to do that either. What is the recommendation?\r\n\r\nAs a tangent: for specs I work on in JS, I frequently see misunderstanings, even among implementers, that asserts would throw an exception when run. The text here is pretty clear that that does not happen, but maybe it should be spelled out even more explicitly, specifically that there is no exception.",
